expert.description:
{Expert Berserk}

Mind spell. The targeted unit as well as any units 1 and 2 hexes away from the target location will randomly attack the nearest units, be they friends or foes.

Area of effect is eighteen hexes greater than Basic Berserk. Hypnotize effect is dispelled from target. Spell effect is valid until target makes an attack, otherwise Berserk duration is unlimited.
